	{
		"name": "execute",
		"title": "Execute raw Lix SQL",
		"description": "Execute 1–100 Lix SQL statements atomically and in order; any failure rolls back all. Active tables use the active branch; use `_by_branch` across branches or `switch_branch` to change it. SQL dialect: Apache DataFusion, not SQLite. DDL and recursive CTEs are unsupported.\n\nCore:\n- `lix_file` — active files: `id, path, directory_id, name, data` (BLOB).\n- `lix_directory` — active directories: `id, path, parent_id, name`.\n- `lix_branch` — branches: `id, name, hidden, commit_id`.\n- `lix_change` — global activity: `id, entity_pk, schema_key, file_id, snapshot_content, metadata, created_at, origin_key`. Use `WHERE NOT starts_with(schema_key,'lix_')` for application-only activity.\n\nFile paths never end in `/`; directory paths always do. `directory_id` references `lix_directory.id`. Top-level directories have `parent_id IS NULL`; other `parent_id` values reference `id`. For descendants: `lix_directory d LEFT JOIN lix_file f ON starts_with(f.path,d.path)`.\n\nFiles, directories, and entity tables have `_by_branch` (`lixcol_branch_id`) and read-only `_history` companions; branch/change do not.\n\nDiscover workspace-specific application schemas only when needed:\n```sql\nSELECT lix_json_get_text(value,'x-lix-key') AS table_name, value AS json_schema\nFROM lix_registered_schema\nWHERE NOT starts_with(lix_json_get_text(value,'x-lix-key'),'lix_')\nORDER BY table_name\n```\n\nCast `data AS TEXT` only for known UTF-8 files. To return matching lines, put `UNNEST(string_to_array(CAST(data AS TEXT), chr(10))) AS line` in a derived `SELECT`, then filter `line` outside it.\n\nTyped `_history` queries require `lixcol_start_commit_id=lix_active_branch_commit_id()`. For complete entity history also filter its user primary-key column(s) (`id` for files/directories), or tombstones and renames may be omitted. Resolve IDs/keys from active rows; for a deleted or old path, use a bounded path lookup in the same history, then query by ID. Metadata: `lixcol_depth` (graph distance; low is close; gaps are normal), `lixcol_observed_commit_id`, and `lixcol_commit_created_at` (chronology); no `lixcol_commit_id`.\n",
		"inputSchema": {
			"$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
			"type": "object",
			"properties": {
				"workspace_ref": {
					"type": "string",
					"description": "Exact workspace UUID, exact workspace slug, or exact @namespace/slug. Use the workspace UUID when available."
				},
				"statements": {
					"minItems": 1,
					"maxItems": 100,
					"type": "array",
					"items": {
						"type": "object",
						"properties": {
							"sql": {
								"type": "string",
								"minLength": 1
							},
							"params": {
								"default": [],
								"maxItems": 1000,
								"type": "array",
								"items": {
									"anyOf": [
										{
											"type": "null"
										},
										{
											"type": "boolean"
										},
										{
											"type": "number",
											"minimum": -9007199254740991,
											"maximum": 9007199254740991
										},
										{
											"type": "string"
										},
										{
											"type": "object",
											"properties": {
												"kind": {
													"type": "string",
													"const": "blob"
												},
												"base64": {
													"type": "string",
													"contentEncoding": "base64",
													"allOf": [
														{
															"pattern": "^$|^(?:[0-9a-zA-Z+/]{4})*(?:(?:[0-9a-zA-Z+/]{2}==)|(?:[0-9a-zA-Z+/]{3}=))?$"
														},
														{
															"pattern": "^$|^(?:[A-Za-z0-9+/]{4})*(?:[A-Za-z0-9+/][AQgw]==|[A-Za-z0-9+/]{2}[AEIMQUYcgkosw048]=)?$"
														}
													]
												}
											},
											"required": ["kind", "base64"],
											"additionalProperties": false
										},
										{
											"type": "object",
											"properties": {
												"kind": {
													"type": "string",
													"const": "json"
												},
												"value": {}
											},
											"required": ["kind", "value"],
											"additionalProperties": false
										},
										{
											"type": "object",
											"properties": {
												"kind": {
													"type": "string",
													"const": "float"
												},
												"value": {
													"type": "number"
												}
											},
											"required": ["kind", "value"],
											"additionalProperties": false,
											"description": "Explicit SQL REAL parameter. Use when an integral value must remain REAL or a finite REAL exceeds the native numeric range."
										}
									],
									"description": "Use JSON null, Boolean, safe-magnitude number, or string directly. Use tagged values only for BLOB, SQL JSON, or the explicit REAL escape."
								}
							}
						},
						"required": ["sql"],
						"additionalProperties": false
					}
				}
			},
			"required": ["workspace_ref", "statements"],
			"additionalProperties": false
		},
		"outputSchema": {
			"$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
			"anyOf": [
				{
					"type": "object",
					"properties": {
						"results": {
							"type": "array",
							"items": {
								"type": "object",
								"properties": {
									"columns": {
										"type": "array",
										"items": {
											"type": "string"
										}
									},
									"rows": {
										"type": "array",
										"items": {
											"type": "array",
											"items": {
												"anyOf": [
													{
														"type": "null"
													},
													{
														"type": "boolean"
													},
													{
														"type": "number"
													},
													{
														"type": "string"
													},
													{
														"type": "object",
														"properties": {
															"kind": {
																"type": "string",
																"const": "blob"
															},
															"base64": {
																"type": "string",
																"contentEncoding": "base64",
																"allOf": [
																	{
																		"pattern": "^$|^(?:[0-9a-zA-Z+/]{4})*(?:(?:[0-9a-zA-Z+/]{2}==)|(?:[0-9a-zA-Z+/]{3}=))?$"
																	},
																	{
																		"pattern": "^$|^(?:[A-Za-z0-9+/]{4})*(?:[A-Za-z0-9+/][AQgw]==|[A-Za-z0-9+/]{2}[AEIMQUYcgkosw048]=)?$"
																	}
																]
															}
														},
														"required": ["kind", "base64"],
														"additionalProperties": false
													},
													{
														"type": "object",
														"properties": {
															"kind": {
																"type": "string",
																"const": "json"
															},
															"value": {}
														},
														"required": ["kind", "value"],
														"additionalProperties": false
													}
												]
											}
										}
									},
									"rowsAffected": {
										"type": "integer",
										"minimum": 0,
										"maximum": 9007199254740991
									},
									"notices": {
										"type": "array",
										"items": {}
									}
								},
								"required": ["columns", "rows", "rowsAffected", "notices"],
								"additionalProperties": false
							}
						}
					},
					"required": ["results"],
					"additionalProperties": false
				},
				{
					"type": "object",
					"properties": {
						"error": {
							"type": "object",
							"properties": {
								"code": {
									"type": "string"
								},
								"message": {
									"type": "string"
								},
								"details": {
									"type": "object",
									"propertyNames": {
										"type": "string"
									},
									"additionalProperties": {}
								}
							},
							"required": ["code", "message"],
							"additionalProperties": false
						}
					},
					"required": ["error"],
					"additionalProperties": false
				}
			],
			"type": "object"
		},
		"securitySchemes": [
			{
				"type": "oauth2",
				"scopes": ["openid", "email", "profile"]
			}
		],
		"annotations": {
			"readOnlyHint": false,
			"destructiveHint": true,
			"openWorldHint": false,
			"idempotentHint": false
		},
		"_meta": {
			"securitySchemes": [
				{
					"type": "oauth2",
					"scopes": ["openid", "email", "profile"]
				}
			]
		}
	}
]
